== Download artifacts 
You can download the artifacts [MLTLM_Artifacts.zip here], and the paper from [https://research.temporallogic.org/papers/NSV22.pdf here]. The artifacts directory can also be cloned from [https://github.com/gokulhari/MLTLM_NSV2022 Github].

